.665, 485.792 138.922, 470.500 136.884 C 453.790 134.658, 402.435 133.498, 384.968 134.952" title="Right Click (Button 2)" />

						<!-- LMB (Left Mouse Button - Near Paddle) -->
						<path id="btn-lmb" class="mouse-btn mouse-btn-part" d="M 479.365 239.510 C 481.423 244.872, 482.125 254.332, 480.977 261.214 C 479.317 271.163, 475.681 278.701, 466.850 290.500 C 454.201 307.399, 427.491 345.343, 406.664 376 C 402.368 382.325, 395.901 391.775, 392.295 397 C 388.689 402.225, 377.608 418.425, 367.671 433 C 347.822 462.113, 305.417 523.489, 284.107 553.950 C 269.618 574.660, 259.527 585.900, 249.508 592.488 C 232.716 603.530, 215.231 605.438, 199.185 597.980 L 192.870 595.044 190.349 600.745 C 184.391 614.218, 172.182 654.919, 167.110 678.218 L 165.212 686.937 181.856 695.314 C 225.291 717.176, 269.821 732.541, 308.243 738.922 C 347.330 745.414, 373.003 743.149, 396.753 731.113 C 419.049 719.814, 450.099 688.722, 482.967 644.781 C 493.950 630.098, 502.485 617.917, 538.171 566 C 613.999 455.683, 647.790 412.111, 704.779 351.169 L 715.058 340.177 712.279 338.247 C 710.751 337.185, 708.150 335.619, 706.500 334.767 C 698.837 330.809, 691.409 326.740, 690.500 326.003 C 689.950 325.557, 687.250 323.976, 684.500 322.489 C 681.750 321.002, 677.475 318.656, 675 317.276 C 664.904 311.647, 631.081 293.905, 622.500 289.736 C 602.340 279.942, 583.181 271, 582.356 271 C 582.100 271, 580.002 270.141, 577.695 269.090 C 559.179 260.661, 526.423 249.592, 500.234 242.913 C 478.724 237.428, 478.556 237.401, 479.365 239.510" title="Left Click (Button 0)" />

